      "id": "q2",
      "type": "explain",
      "q": "When should you stop researching?",
      "a": "When independent good sources agree and keep reappearing, when remaining uncertainty would not change the decision, or when cost exceeds value.",
      "anchor": "#when-to-stop",
      "origin": "ai",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "q3",
      "type": "explain",
      "q": "Why learn the experts' vocabulary early in a search?",
      "a": "Professionals use specific terms that retrieve better sources than everyday words.",
